---
// src/components/TechnicalToolkit.astro
---

<div class="technical-toolkit-container">

    <div class="options-disclaimer">
        <h3>Prototipos de Diseño</h3>
        <p>A continuación se muestran las dos opciones. Los Emojis han sido reemplazados por una estructura más limpia y las insignias oficiales se han integrado.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <!-- PROPUESTA 2: EL ECOSISTEMA / PIPELINE          -->
    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <section class="toolkit-proposal">
        <h2 class="proposal-title">Propuesta 2: Pipeline y Flujo de Trabajo</h2>
        <p class="proposal-desc">Agrupa las herramientas por fase de desarrollo, mostrando cómo conectas todo el proceso.</p>
        
        <div class="pipeline-grid">
            
            <!-- Etapa 1: DCC -->
            <div class="pipeline-stage">
                <div class="stage-header">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path><polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg>
                    <h3>DCC & Asset Creation</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="stage-content">
                    <div class="tool-item">
                        <strong>Autodesk Maya</strong>
                        <span>Modelado, Retopología, UVS, LookDev</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tool-item">
                        <strong>Substance Painter</strong>
                        <span>PBR Texturing, Smart Materials</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Etapa 2: Engine -->
            <div class="pipeline-stage">
                <div class="stage-header">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"></line><line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"></line></svg>
                    <h3>Engine & Integration</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="stage-content">
                    <div class="tool-item">
                        <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>
                        <span>Blueprints, Sequencer, Material Graph</span>
                        <a href="https://credsverse.com/credentials/90ab0332-b868-4ee4-8574-9d6c3e1a704b?preview=1" target="_blank" class="cert-link">
                            🏅 Avalado por Max Sarlija (Blockchain Cert)
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tool-item">
                        <strong>Unity</strong>
                        <span>Implementación base, C#</span>
                        <!-- Credly Badge Unity -->
                        <div class="badge-container-small">
                            <div data-iframe-width="150" data-iframe-height="270" data-share-badge-id="024ff9bf-12cb-4554-8d47-de60b0c4a875" data-share-badge-host="https://www.credly.com"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Etapa 3: Scripting & Cloud -->
            <div class="pipeline-stage">
                <div class="stage-header">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg>
                    <h3>Tooling, Scripting & Cloud</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="stage-content">
                    <div class="tool-item">
                        <strong>Python / MEL / C++</strong>
                        <span>Pipeline Scripts, Automatización, Lógica base</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tool-item">
                        <strong>AWS & WebTech</strong>
                        <span>Cloud foundations, JS, Astro</span>
                        <!-- Credly Badge AWS -->
                        <div class="badge-container-small">
                            <div data-iframe-width="150" data-iframe-height="270" data-share-badge-id="f5617a2c-269c-4200-9436-0bdf31720b6c" data-share-badge-host="https://www.credly.com"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <!-- PROPUESTA 3: TARJETAS DE ESPECIALIZACIÓN       -->
    <!-- ============================================== -->
    <section class="toolkit-proposal">
        <h2 class="proposal-title">Propuesta 3: Tarjetas de Especialización</h2>
        <p class="proposal-desc">Formato Grid clásico enfocado en Casos de Uso reales y logotipos limpios (ideal si quieres tarjetas separadas).</p>

        <div class="specialization-grid">
            
            <div class="spec-card cert-highlight">
                <div class="spec-header">
                    <h3>Unreal Engine 5</h3>
                    <span class="spec-badge">Core Skill</span>
                </div>
                <p>Desarrollo de Blueprints, integración de Sequencer y creación avanzada de Material Graphs.</p>
                <div class="cert-box">
                    <a href="https://credsverse.com/credentials/90ab0332-b868-4ee4-8574-9d6c3e1a704b?preview=1" target="_blank">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="7"></circle><polyline points="8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88"></polyline></svg>
                        Verificado por Max Sarlija (Blockchain)
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="spec-card">
                <div class="spec-header">
                    <h3>Python / C++</h3>
                </div>
                <p>Programación de herramientas para el Pipeline (Python/MEL) y lógica base/plugins para el motor (C++).</p>
            </div>

            <div class="spec-card">
                <div class="spec-header">
                    <h3>Autodesk Maya & Substance</h3>
                </div>
                <p>Modelado 3D, retopología optimizada y texturizado PBR mediante Smart Materials.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Certificaciones Oficiales Credly -->
            <div class="spec-card badges-card">
                <h3>Certificaciones Oficiales</h3>
                <div class="credly-badges-wrapper">
                    <div class="credly-badge">
                        <div data-iframe-width="150" data-iframe-height="270" data-share-badge-id="024ff9bf-12cb-4554-8d47-de60b0c4a875" data-share-badge-host="https://www.credly.com"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="credly-badge">
                        <div data-iframe-width="150" data-iframe-height="270" data-share-badge-id="f5617a2c-269c-4200-9436-0bdf31720b6c" data-share-badge-host="https://www.credly.com"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

</div>

<!-- Script de Credly genérico (Solo se necesita una vez por página) -->
<script is:inline type="text/javascript" async src="//cdn.credly.com/assets/utilities/embed.js"></script>

<style>
    .technical-toolkit-container {
        margin: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: var(--spacing-xxl);
    }

    .options-disclaimer {
        background: rgba(var(--color-primary-light-rgb), 0.1);
        border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary-light);
        padding: var(--spacing-md);
        border-radius: 4px;
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .options-disclaimer {
        border-left-color: var(--color-primary-dark);
        background: rgba(var(--color-primary-dark-rgb), 0.1);
    }

    .proposal-title {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--color-primary-light);
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .proposal-title {
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }
    .proposal-desc {
        color: var(--color-secondary-light);
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .proposal-desc {
        color: var(--color-secondary-dark);
    }

    /* === ESTILOS PROPUESTA 2: PIPELINE === */
    .pipeline-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
        gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .pipeline-stage {
        background-color: var(--color-card-bg-light);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
        border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
        padding: var(--spacing-lg);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .pipeline-stage {
        background-color: var(--color-card-bg-dark);
        border-color: var(--color-border-dark);
    }
    
    .pipeline-stage:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        border-color: var(--color-primary-light);
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .pipeline-stage:hover {
        border-color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }

    .stage-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        padding-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
        color: var(--color-text-light);
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .stage-header {
        border-bottom-color: var(--color-border-dark);
        color: var(--color-text-dark);
    }
    .stage-header svg {
        color: var(--color-primary-light);
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .stage-header svg {
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }

    .tool-item {
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
    }
    .tool-item strong {
        color: var(--color-text-light);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .tool-item strong {
        color: var(--color-text-dark);
    }
    .tool-item span {
        color: var(--color-secondary-light);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .tool-item span {
        color: var(--color-secondary-dark);
    }

    .cert-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 8px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #d4af37; /* Gold color for cert */
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    .cert-link:hover {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .badge-container-small {
        margin-top: 10px;
        /* Escalar los badges de credly para que entren prolijos en la lista */
        transform: scale(0.85);
        transform-origin: left top;
        height: 230px; /* Compensa la escala para no dejar espacio extra */
    }

    /* === ESTILOS PROPUESTA 3: ESPECIALIZACIÓN === */
    .specialization-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .spec-card {
        background-color: var(--color-card-bg-light);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
        border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
        padding: var(--spacing-lg);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .spec-card {
        background-color: var(--color-card-bg-dark);
        border-color: var(--color-border-dark);
    }

    .spec-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    }

    .spec-header h3 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--color-text-light);
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .spec-header h3 {
        color: var(--color-text-dark);
    }

    .spec-badge {
        background: var(--color-primary-light);
        color: white;
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .spec-badge {
        background: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }

    .spec-card p {
        color: var(--color-secondary-light);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        flex-grow: 1;
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .spec-card p {
        color: var(--color-secondary-dark);
    }

    .cert-box {
        margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
        padding-top: var(--spacing-sm);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .cert-box {
        border-top-color: var(--color-border-dark);
    }
    .cert-box a {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-primary-light);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    :global(body.mode-dark) .cert-box a {
        color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }

    .badges-card {
        grid-column: 1 / -1; /* Ocupa todo el ancho al final */
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
    }
    
    .credly-badges-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        gap: var(--spacing-lg);
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
    }

</style>
